    content:
      "The brand KAF BY KAF was founded by Kawthar Alhoraish in 2019, a Saudi fashion designer. Kawthar Alhoraish always had a different perspective in fashion. Her style was always bold & unique that what influence the brand KAF BY KAF the most.\nThe brand aims to revolutionizing the cultural aspect of the outwear by creating bold & creative designs from an artistic perspective",
